---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';import '../../../../styles/equipment.css';
const p='/equipment/16-15/';
---
<Layout pageTitle="Laboratory storage and lighting" subtitle="" wide={true} description="Set up reusable lab props and check that lighting and storage stay independent."><script is:inline>window.propsModule=import('/equipment/16-15/kit.mjs');</script><article class="equipment" id="lab-props"><nav class="eq-nav"><a href="/simulations/equipment/16-15/">← Equipment 16-15</a><a href="/simulations/equipment/">Register</a><a href="#props-proof">Verification</a></nav><header class="eq-mast"><p class="eq-meta">16-15 / WORKSHOP SUPPORT</p><h2>Put it away. Turn on the light.</h2><p class="eq-lede">Store the labeled case in the cream cabinet, close and reopen the drawer, and turn on the brass task lamp. The item stays in the same slot. Only the task illumination changes.</p></header>
<div class="cols"><section><p class="eq-meta">01 / ASSET KIT</p><h3>BTS Support Props Mk I</h3><div id="prop-view" aria-label="Interactive cabinet, stool, amber screen and task light"></div><small id="prop-model" role="status">Loading metric props…</small><div class="tools"><button id="prop-full">Whole prop kit</button><button id="prop-near">Storage detail</button><button id="prop-lights">Lamp detail</button></div><p>Drag to orbit, scroll or pinch to zoom. Click the drawer handle, cabinet handle, case or lamp switch directly. All controls are also available at right.</p></section>
<section><p class="eq-meta">02 / CONTROLS</p><h3>Storage and task lighting</h3><div class="tools"><button id="prop-drawer" class="run">Open drawer</button><button id="prop-door">Open cabinet door</button><button id="prop-lamp" aria-pressed="false">Switch lamp on</button></div><div class="tools"><button id="prop-grab">Grab labeled case</button><button id="prop-store">Place in drawer</button><button id="prop-top">Return to top</button></div><label>Stool seat height: <output id="prop-seat-value">485 mm</output><input id="prop-stool" type="range" value="485" min="485" max="635" step="5"/></label><p id="prop-status" role="status">Ready.</p><button id="prop-reset">Reset scene</button><p>Changing the stool height or opening the cupboard door does not change case attachment or illumination.</p></section></div>
<section><p class="eq-meta">03 / LIVE STATE</p><h3>Local pose, slot and beam</h3><p id="prop-location" aria-live="polite"></p><p id="prop-light-state"></p><div class="tools"><button id="prop-save">Export scene state JSON</button><a href={p+'example-scene.json'}>Example stocked scene</a></div></section>
<section id="props-proof"><p class="eq-meta">04 / DIMENSIONS & VERIFICATION</p><h3>Original units and isolated actions</h3><div class="over"><table><thead><tr><th>Original prop</th><th>Nominal modeled dimensions or state</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>Cream cabinet</th><td>620 W × 510 D × 1,180 H mm; 285 mm drawer travel, 105° door visualization</td></tr><tr><th>Olive stool</th><td>346 mm seat diameter; authored adjustable range 485–635 mm</td></tr><tr><th>Amber partition</th><td>550 mm pane width, 8 mm illustrative thickness, 1,620 mm overall frame height</td></tr><tr><th>PPE case and brass lamp</th><td>180 mm wide case, stable ID PPE-CASE-01; binary normalized visual lighting only</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p>The item stores a parent ID and a local position for slot D1-01. Opening shifts the parent +285 mm toward the operator; closing reverses that shift without modifying its contents. The lamp alters a localized renderer spotlight and lens emission, leaving ambient light fixed. Its independent acceptance test compares the complete exported scene before and after switching, ignoring only the incremented revision and changed illumination. The same item and pose survive exactly. Attempted transfer while the drawer is shut is rejected.</p><p>All dimensions are design choices, not manufacturer measurements. Amber glass is a decorative color/opacity only, not spectral filtering or a safe optical barrier. This artwork is not PPE, a structural design, or a measured task-light installation. Moving parts are illustrative, without real clearance or swept collision certification. Virtual modifications here do not alter any saved lab model.</p><div class="tools"><a href={p+'build-model.py'} download>Editable Blender source</a><a href={p+'lab-support.glb'} download>Download GLB</a><a href={p+'xr.json'}>Metric checks and VR anchors</a><a href={p+'kit.mjs'}>Actions and scene schema</a></div><p>State export <code>bts.lab-support-layout.v1</code> includes fixture, item/slot IDs, revision and local/world metre poses with +Y up, +Z toward the operator. The editable prop kit can be reused directly in metre-scale VR; this first-pass page does not verify a physical headset session.</p></section>
</article></Layout><script>import '../../../../lib/equipment/16-15/client.mjs';</script><style is:global>
#lab-props .cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.13fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:.8rem}#lab-props section{border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1rem;margin:.8rem 0;min-width:0}#lab-props .cols section{margin:0}#lab-props .eq-meta{margin:0}#lab-props h3{margin:.35rem 0 .62rem;font-size:1.5rem}#lab-props .tools{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:.45rem;margin:.65rem 0}#lab-props button,#lab-props input{min-height:40px;padding:.35rem;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;font:inherit;border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--panel,transparent);color:var(--text)}#lab-props button{cursor:pointer}#lab-props button.run{background:#355e4f;color:white}#lab-props label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.25rem}#prop-view{height:clamp(268px,32vw,420px);background:#293637}#prop-view canvas{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;touch-action:none}#lab-props .over{overflow:auto}#lab-props table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}#lab-props th,#lab-props td{text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:.4rem}#prop-location,#prop-light-state{font-weight:bold}#lab-props code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}@media(max-width:760px){#lab-props .cols{grid-template-columns:1fr}#lab-props section{padding:.68rem}}
</style>
